    "A BOUND_COMPENSATION manifest identifies one immutable parent and grant. Its fresh exact child action binds the current process generation proven by trigger evidence and otherwise matches the grant action projection/effect exactly; its receipt revalidates child, parent and grant. Self-parenting, ancestry cycles, substitutions, branch widening and unrelated authorizations are rejected.",
    "issued_at <= issuance_revocation_checked_at < expires_at and the issuance status/anchor are historical evidence only. Every operation contract carries a fresh receipt validating against the frozen revocation authority ID, protected anchor path, receipt schema and maximum age; the caller cannot substitute a source or extend valid_until. This immutable manifest cannot self-prove that it remains unrevoked.",
    "For each data scope, DOCUMENT candidate tuples are indivisible and document_id, source_id, and binding tuple keys are unique. ROOT_ONLY is allowed only for an explicitly declared A1 discovery action or a runtime template root; the fresh cycle intent must replace it with exact DOCUMENT tuples before document processing or egress.",
