    "Provider scopes are unique by (provider_id, model_id, destination_id); duplicate or conflicting caps are invalid. max_requests includes initial and retry calls as declared by the request policy, max_retries cannot imply more requests than max_requests, and all providers in one runtime authorization use billing_currency equal to runtime budget_currency. Runtime template per-cycle maxima cannot exceed provider maxima, and global aggregate durable daily/monthly counters may only reduce what remains authorized.",
