    "Only RUNTIME_TEMPLATE_SPECIALIZATION may authorize OP-RUNTIME-CYCLE. Its template validates against operation_intent_template.schema.json; repeated data/provider/maxima/budget/currency/refresh and process-generation-policy fields plus the action template hash exactly match. The runtime action uses MONOTONIC_CURRENT_PROTECTED_STATE rather than a reusable exact generation. Its four global aggregate durable budget IDs are distinct, maxima do not exceed provider/data scopes, and any listed refresh trigger invalidates authorization before preflight or side effects.",
